      <title>格雷厄姆和特朗普的胜利：南卡罗来纳州参议院决选的六点收获</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/election-takeaways-south-carolina-oklahoma.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普总统在周二的初选决选中全力支持参议员达林·格雷厄姆。这一招奏效了，让他在今年的共和党参议院初选中保持了不败纪录。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/us/politics/election-takeaways-south-carolina-oklahoma.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 08:07:06 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
